      "walkthrough": [
        "Evaluate the derivative at $x = 1$ to find the tangent gradient:\n$$f'(1) = 8(2(1) - 3)^{1/3} - 10(1)^{2/3} = 8(-1)^{1/3} - 10(1) = 8(-1) - 10 = -18$$",
        "Determine the perpendicular normal gradient:\n$$m_{\\text{norm}} = -\\frac{1}{f'(1)} = -\\frac{1}{-18} = \\frac{1}{18}$$",
        "Form the equation of the normal line passing through $(1, 0)$:\n$$y - 0 = \\frac{1}{18}(x - 1) \\implies y = \\frac{x - 1}{18}$$"
